==[[Range/Lore|The Range's lore assets]]==
===[[Range/Lore/V25|Season 2025]]===
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone105.mp3}} "Cucho, listen. If you expect me to apologize for what happened all those years ago, you don't remember me very well. We cannot bring back the dead, mi hermano. How many more will die unless we focus on the fight at hand? What comes next will not be easy... but if your team is as trustworthy as you say, we may just survive."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone107.mp3}} "Qué hubo Brimstone, perhaps I did not make myself clear. We are facing a serious threat. As of now, these kids you've trained aren't going to cut it. You need someone who can keep the younger ones in line; talk shit with them, talk business with us. I have someone in mind. Lucky for you, she's been working with me for a long time. I'll make the introduction. Adiós, cucho."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone111.mp3}} "Brimstone, I reviewed the team's routine report on Omega activity, something caught my eye. There is an increase in military-grade energy production and transport. It is behavior I have seen before when my old clients in weapons R&D would bring a project into full production. The Omega markets are different than ours, it is true, but... I don't like the smell of it. Someone is building something, hermano, something big. It behooves us to find out what."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone113.mp3}} "Brimstone, hermano. I'm told you're not joining us later to watch the game. All these years and you're still sticking with your hijueputa "I only watch baseball". Why watch people just stand around for five hours?! Let me tell you something; this is how you lose the respect of the young people on your team. Football is everything, cucho. We'll talk more when we see you. Tonight."
*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone116.mp3}} "What did I tell you? You should listen to me more often, hermano. Would save us time. Paris is safe and Atlas is bleeding. They're going to be on bed rest for a while, which gives us time to do the same. You know how it is, another apocalypse is just around the corner. But now, we relax! We're overdue for a few drinks. I'll bring over a bottle I've been saving, okay? Adiós, my friend."

